@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:7280

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Create knowledge base
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge-bases
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "产品与工程知识库"
}

### Upload a local text or Markdown file
# Replace the knowledgeBaseId with the ID returned above.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge-bases/{{knowledgeBaseId}}/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=rag-demo-boundary

--rag-demo-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.md"
Content-Type: text/markdown

# Sample knowledge
Aspros RAG stores canonical document and chunk content in a relational database.
Vector indexes are derived data and can be rebuilt.
--rag-demo-boundary--

### Check ingestion job
# Replace jobId with the returned job ID.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ingestion-jobs/{{jobId}}

### List documents
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge-bases/{{knowledgeBaseId}}/documents

### Read chunks
# Replace documentId with the returned document ID.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/{{documentId}}/chunks
